e designed to introduce you to virtual reality. Explore the 7 levels and try to beat your high score !\n{1369934868174516}\n# Main Gameplay Elements :\n\n- **Environment & Level** : Experience seven closed environments that you can replay endlessly to beat your high score!\n\n- **Gameplay :** Jump straight into the action, no tutorial required.\n\n- **Game physics :** Enjoy partially destructible environments where you can practice and refine your shooting skills.\n\n- **Weapons :** Choose between one or two rifles for extra fun.\n{807953895607114}\n\n- **Enemies :** Face off against wooden target dummies that represent your enemies, turning the game into a true shooting range experience!\n\n- **Bosses :** Encounter surprising and entertaining bosses that vary depending on the level.\n\n- **Scoring :** Your score depends on both the number of targets you hit and your shooting accuracy, missing a target may cause you to lose bonus points.\n\n- **Replayability :** Play again to improve your score and try out different strategies!\n\n{1428852595510134}", "short_description": "Saddle up, cowboy! Step into Wild West Panic, the craziest VR shootout! Smash targets, rack up points, and prove you\u2019re the fastest gun alive ! A super-casual single-player game, engaging fun. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.vigo-creative.com/PRIVACY_POLICY/PrivacyPolicyWildWestPanicENG.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Vigo Creative", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vigo-creative.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recomme